<title>THAILAND: Bank of Asia cuts lending rates.</title>
<headline>Bank of Asia cuts lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Bank of Asia said on Monday it was cutting all the key lending rates by 25 basis points, effective Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The bank cut its minimum overdraft rate (MOR), minimum lending rate (MLR) and minimum retail rate (MRR) to 14.25 percent from 14.50 percent.</p>
<p>It kept fixed deposit rates unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
